OL,3,GNEWSAMillions to get #100 energy
OL,4,Apayment after Budget as OBR says
OL,5,Adisposable incomes unlikely to grow
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey says 20 million
OL,8,Fhouseholds in council tax bands A-D in
OL,9,FEngland will receive a #100 "household
OL,10,Fenergy payment" in his first Budget
OL,12,FFunding will be allocated to devolved
OL,13,Fgovernments, with Wales saying it will
OL,14,Fmatch the payment and the Scottish
OL,15,Fgovernment planning to "replicate" it
OL,17,FBanks will pay an extra 3% surcharge on
OL,18,Fprofits, which will be "time-limited" -
OL,19,Fa smaller tax rise than expected
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
